{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2023-05-23 09:00:00', 'title': 'DUPONT WALLCOVERING BY WALLQUEST INC. GENERATES BUZZ AT HOSPITALITY & DESIGN EXPO IN LAS VEGAS', 'text': 'WILMINGTON, DEL. , MAY. 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUPONT (NYSE:DD) AND ITS CUSTOMER WALLQUEST INC. EXHIBITED AT THE ANNUAL HOSPITALITY & DESIGN EXPO IN LAS VEGAS EARLIER THIS MONTH.'}{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2023-05-23 02:00:00', 'title': 'DUPONT™ KAPTON® MT+ BASED SLOT LINER SOLUTION IMPROVES THERMAL MANAGEMENT AND EFFICIENCY IN HIGH-VOLTAGE E-MOTORS', 'text': 'KAPTON® MT+ DELIVERS HIGH THERMAL CONDUCTIVITY FOR COOLER-RUNNING, MORE EFFICIENT MOTORS IN NEXT-GENERATION ELECTRIC VEHICLES WILMINGTON DEL. , MAY 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUPONT (NYSE:DD) INTERCONNECT SOLUTIONS, PART OF THE ELECTRONICS & INDUSTRIAL\xa0BUSINESS SEGMENT, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT A LEADING PROVIDER OF MOBILITY SYSTEM SOLUTIONS HAS INTEGRATED DUPONT™ KAPTON® MT+\xa0BASED NKN (NOMEX®/KAPTON®/NOMEX®) SLOT LINERS INTO 800V E-MOTORS FOR A HIGH-END ELECTRIC VEHICLE (EV) MANUFACTURER.'}